5,1,1,talk,Victoria,,We need to agree on what evidence matters before we pick a plan.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I read the closure reports first. We keep repeating old mistakes because nobody checks what happened last time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I want to know who else has to say yes before we trust any delivery date.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the long-term costs. We need to see what these plans actually commit us to paying for later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to know where the time actually goes! Are we fixing the crowds or the waiting?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Daisuke, your point about long-term costs is valid. @Toshio, who else must approve these plans?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Daisuke"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, the joint operators' committee minutes show who holds the keys. I'll check those.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
