35,2,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, the roster books show the late-turn pool is nearly empty. Overtime is covering everything.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, that’s grim. I found the old pilots succeeded, but the accessibility records show lane priorities failed.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, the shells are a trap. Bidders price heavy contingency after three jobs hit unrecorded voids.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Daisuke, the ledger shows a ring-fenced grant, but the operating subsidy was trimmed again. The ticketing fees are eating our paving budget.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Sakura, the audits say we lose time waiting for connections, not paying! The mid-city runs are slower, but platforms clear fine.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, if connections are the bottleneck, extending night hours might just add more waiting. @Toshio, do the committee minutes show if we can even coordinate those connections?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Toshio, the minutes show the ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms. That coordination is missing.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, that confirms it. The ferry and rail back offices never agreed on data terms. We cannot promise integrated connections without their consent.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, the rosters confirm your fear. We are running on overtime, and the maintenance contract has no spare capacity.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, that’s exactly why I checked! We’re fixing the wrong part. The waiting is the real cost, not the crowds.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, if the back offices won’t share data, how do we guarantee the connections work?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, we can’t. The minutes prove they won’t agree on data terms. Any plan needing their cooperation is a gamble.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, exactly. Without their consent, we cannot promise integrated connections. The ground and the committees both block us.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, the ledger shows the operating subsidy is already trimmed. We can’t promise new services without breaking the long-term budget.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, so if we can't fix the connections, maybe we should just stop pretending the crowds are the problem?","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, you’re right. We must stop chasing the noise. @Daisuke, does the ledger allow for a plan that doesn’t need new money?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Daisuke, the old pilots show we can succeed without new money. The ferry trial closed cleanly, and the late-evening pilot hit its cost target.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the committee minutes show roadway consents are already delegated to us. We can proceed without their approval.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, the ring-fenced grant is locked, but the ticketing fees are a recurring drain. We need a plan that stops that bleeding.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, if the fees are the drain, maybe we should look at the ticketing system itself? It’s the only thing we fully control!","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
