60,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, the fare platform is the only candidate we fully control. It stops the fee drain and needs no new crews.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Victoria, I agree. The old pilots prove we can succeed without new money. The fare platform fits that perfectly.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"@Victoria, the minutes confirm we hold the consents. No external approvals needed. The fare platform is the only path that avoids the committee deadlock.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"@Victoria, the fare platform stops the recurring fee drain. It’s the only option that doesn’t break our already-trimmed long-term budget.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, I agree! The audits showed paying isn't the bottleneck, but stopping the fee drain is still smart. I vote for the fare platform.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Victoria,,I vote for the Integrated Fare Platform. It is the only option that respects our staffing limits and stops the financial leak.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Takumi,,I vote for the Integrated Fare Platform. It avoids the committee deadlock and the ground risks we all identified.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Toshio,,I vote for the Integrated Fare Platform. It is the only plan that avoids the unresolvable committee deadlock and the ground risks.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,I vote for the Integrated Fare Platform. It stops the recurring fee drain and respects our trimmed long-term budget.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"I vote for the Integrated Fare Platform! It’s the only one we can actually control, and it stops the money leak.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Victoria,,The vote is unanimous. The Integrated Fare Platform is selected for the board.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Takumi,,I’m glad we found a path that doesn’t repeat our old mistakes. The closure reports will finally have a happy ending.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Toshio,,"I am satisfied. The consents are clear, and the risks are contained. We proceed.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I’m relieved. It feels safer knowing we aren’t promising money we don’t have. Thank you for listening.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"I’m so happy we picked the one that actually makes sense! No more guessing games, just a plan we can really do.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Victoria,,Thank you all. The evidence guided us to a sustainable choice. I will forward the Integrated Fare Platform to the board.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Takumi,,"I’ll read the closure report for this one, just to be sure we’re not making the same mistake again.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will monitor the implementation. If the data terms remain unresolved, the integration will fail, and I will report it.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Daisuke,,I’ll keep watching the ledger to make sure the fees actually stop. Thank you for making this easier.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Sakura,,I’ll keep checking the journey audits to make sure the waiting time actually drops! Let’s make this work!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
